  "static_behavior_findings": [
    "Three positive lunar offsets only: 45, 90, 135 degrees modulo 360 in integer arcseconds; no 180-degree point or later series.",
    "Zero longitude is valid; None is unresolved. Invalid bool, float, negative and full-circle input handling is covered by the copied suite and confirmed in source code.",
    "Chronic course gives not_applicable; unknown course/origin or missing longitude gives unresolved; no calendar date or outcome is calculated.",
    "The caller supplies the already corrected longitude and a selected-origin status. The helper does not verify an ephemeris, chart construction or actual occurrence of a patient event.",
    "Bed-hour priority and physician-request fallback match the local paragraph. The unknown/unavailable distinction is an explicitly disclosed conservative implementation convention.",
    "Time labels are passed through unchanged. Sign and house options remain separate; no automatic unit choice, duration or date is produced.",
    "The helper does not implement the six/twelve-degree danger language, disease catalogue, mind/body rules, clinical diagnosis, prognosis or treatment."
  ],
